# plant-room-form.trk -- one row per bar (100), slewed in the patch.
track drums cva   # 1  kick and clap
track hats  cva   # 2
track pipes cva   # 3
track bass  cva   # 4
track bcut  cva   # 5  bass filter, the build
track stab  cva   # 6
track steam cva   # 7
track rumb  cva   # 8  the kick's rumble
track main  cva   # 9

pattern form 100
