15 | .    | .8   | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .
16 | 1    | .9   | .7   | .9   | .2>  | .7   | .7   | .8   | .     # A
47 | .    | .    | .    | .    | .65  | .    | .    | .    | .
48 | 0    | .2   | .65  | 0    | 0    | 0    | .55  | 0    | .     # break: pipes, the figure, steam
60 | .    | .5>  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .
63 | .    | .9   | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .
64 | 1    | 1    | .7   | 1    | .4>  | .8   | .8   | .9   | .     # B
91 | .    | .    | .    | .    | .8   | .    | .    | .    | .
92 | .9   | .7   | .6   | 0    | 0    | 0    | .3   | .7   | .     # outro
96 | .    | .4   | .    | .    | .    | .    | 0    | .    | 1>
99 | .5   | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | .    | 0

